99526861\n\n[Definition of done](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/57b07ec8be98080f91a460e2e31267a20151c0a5/docs/pinned-prerequisite-skip.md) preceded source and collection. Source `7fb8f8a` passed both locked base roles (5,674 passed, 73 skipped, 150 deselected each), both fixed optional roles (2,581 on Python 3.11; 2,579 and two expected skips on 3.12), hooks, license reads and closed 486-path guards. [CI #601](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44461179593) passed both actual runtimes on an identical source tree. The [35-member source archive](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/316bfb3601d6eeeac627f3ce1fcf9d0d618bbd1c/results/guarded-prerequisite-skip/source-checks/manifest.json) was published and GitHub-byte-verified before any archived read.\n\nOne fresh [reference-free own proof](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/e323279ee48d9d9d5d7c87913d29561d48497fda/results/guarded-prerequisite-skip/own/manifest.json) passed under 180 seconds at clean `316bfb3`, with one original loader and six guarded returns. Its three raw members were public and byte-verified before the single fixed ordinary→guarded-skip pair.\n\n**Observed outcome: failed unchanged work-identity gate.** Both complete children finished under 900 seconds: ordinary 557.21 seconds with 14 original loads; guarded 602.25 seconds with two original loads and 12 guarded returns. The pair finished under 1,800 seconds at 1,163.73 seconds, with matching scientific result/context, 432 profiles, 1,152 conditions and three native workers. Four saved work counters changed: normalization requests/reduced evaluations 918,104→726,200; validation-cache requests 8,316→8,220, hits 8,290→8,194. The unchanged gate rejected the pair as `failed_retained`. No favorable retry, CPU-saving claim, training or strategy admission. The [31-member raw failure](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/aa3c9c2936e245719ce3edd46927b0e2964ea0df/results/guarded-prerequisite-skip/pair-raw/manifest.json) is published and GitHub-byte-verified.\n\nThe [data-only failure report](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/4559b42666363a96520b0571a76393ba73707d4b/docs/pinned-prerequisite-skip-result.md), tamper tests and identical two-runtime JSON were published at `4559b42` after complete exact-head local qualification. Both base roles passed 5,685 tests with 73 skips and 150 deselections; fixed optional roles passed 2,592 on Python 3.11 and 2,590 with two expected skips on Python 3.12. Ruff, strict mypy, hooks and before/after guards passed. The first full-check launcher attempt stopped before tests on a suite-list assertion typo; its logs were retained, and the corrected fresh attempt passed. [Hosted report CI #605](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44471843556) is running. Next: retain and verify both hosted jobs, publish a final check receipt, history-preserving merge, then a separate prospective bounded river-strength experiment per the user's November 18 direction. Further validation-performance investigations are deferred unless they block correctness or that experiment's budget.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-19T04:18:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:24:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2337974d0e2fd16ecafa55de240dcf3f1f7046ba","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/pinned-prerequisite-skip","ref":"research/pinned-prerequisite-skip","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/